WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,040
Challenge failed next

2
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,440
I said there was only one person left

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:08,080
You don't expect him to lift the fifth gear, do you?

4
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:10,100
If we want to talk about appearance

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,740
This one of yours is truly the best among all the others.

6
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,980
But when it comes to strength, just save it.

7
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:22,130
Just go ahead and try lifting it. Can you change it to another one?

8
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,000
You don't want to challenge the first slot

9
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,320
Did you know that you only have one chance to challenge

10
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:31,400
If you fail, you can't try again.

11
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:32,960
Let him challenge it

12
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:34,120
We also want to see

13
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,300
When is the military camp?

14
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:38,700
This has become the place where a pretty boy like this should come.

15
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:42,660
If it doesn't work, just get off the stage and go home to look for milk, boy.

16
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:44,580
My third uncle’s thirteen-year-old sister-in-law

17
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:45,620
They are all stronger than you

18
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,860
Come down quickly and don't waste everyone's time. I understand.

19
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:54,850
But I still insist that you go and change it.

20
00:00:55,250 --> 00:01:04,940
Is it possible that this guy wants to do something?

21
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:06,420
The second one is not hard enough

22
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:08,500
I also want to directly challenge the third one

23
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:10,100
Doesn't he find it embarrassing?
